<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Lembaga hendaklah melantik apa-apa bilangan pegawai dan pekhidmat Lembaga sebagaimana yang difikirkan perlu oleh Lembaga dari semasa ke semasa."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@/~part_III__cl_19> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Lembaga hendaklah mempunyai kuasa untuk merangka dan mengawal selia tatacara pelantikan pegawai dan pekhidmatnya."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@> .
