<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@/~sched_1__para_3__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/33/msa@> .
